{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o104a","title":"孙权遣宿舒孙综还使张弥许晏贺达率万人授公孙渊九锡","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o104a-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"孙权遣宿舒孙综还使张弥许晏贺达率万人授公孙渊九锡","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o104a-q"]},{"id":"wuzhu-a-p054-judgment","label":"裴松之论","text":"裴松之认为信渊已定而以万人宣命，是不爱其民。","evidence":["wuzhu-q-p054-judgment"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"遣使","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o104a-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0068","role":"返辽东","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o104a-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0069","role":"返辽东","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o104a-q"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0035","role":"奉使","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o104a-q"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0036","role":"奉使","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o104a-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0070","role":"领军","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o104a-q"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0013","role":"被授","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o104a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":233,"label":"三月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y233","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o103","basis":"三月"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o104a-q","wuzhu-q-o103","mingdi-q-o030","mingdi-q-o037","mingdi-q-b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o104a-q","source_order":[47,526,"O104a"],"order":8305}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0013","name":"公孙渊","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"mingdi-p0035","name":"张弥","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"mingdi-p0036","name":"许晏","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0068","name":"宿舒","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0069","name":"孙综","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0070","name":"贺达","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"mingdi-q-b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：青龙二年（公元 234）。己未：旧历初四日。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":252,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6c0753fe684a18a3a281","start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o030","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-cb99fef1996d806deb1c","layer":"original","quote":"青龙元年春正月，甲申〖1〗，青龙现郏之摩陂井中〖2〗。二月，丁酉〖3〗，幸摩陂观龙。于是改年，改摩陂为龙陂。赐男子爵，人二级；鳏寡孤独。无出今年租赋。三月，甲子〖4〗，诏公卿举贤良、笃行之士。各一人。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":100,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o037","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-ff97c2d326d0fc08a9de","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月，（乙）〔己〕未〖1〗，太白犯荧惑。癸酉〖2〗，诏曰：“‘鞭作官刑〖3〗’，所以纠慢怠也〖4〗；而顷多以无辜死。其减鞭杖之制〖5〗，著于令。”三月，庚寅〖6〗，山阳公薨；帝素服发哀〖7〗，遣使持节，典护丧事。己酉〖8〗，大赦。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":249,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":118,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o104a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-c08f51e897f709524a8b","layer":"original","quote":"三月，遣舒、综还；使太常张弥、执金吾许晏、将军贺达等将兵万人〖18〗，金宝珍货，九锡备物，乘海授渊。﹝二﹞","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":14,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":53,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o103","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-f2d17fe961012277706a","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖4〗，诏曰：“朕以不德，肇受元命〖5〗；夙夜兢兢，不遑假寝〖6〗。思平世难，救济黎庶〖7〗；上答神祇，下慰民望。是以眷眷〖8〗，勤求俊杰；将与戮力，共定海内；苟在同心〖9〗，与之偕老。今使持节、督幽州、领青州牧、辽东太守、燕王〖10〗，久胁贼虏，隔在一方；虽乃心于国，其路靡缘〖11〗。今因天命，远遣二使；款诚显露，章表殷勤。朕之得此，何喜如之！虽汤遇伊尹〖12〗，周获吕望〖13〗，世祖未定而得河右〖14〗；方之今日，岂复是过？普天一统，于是定矣！《书》不云乎：‘一人有庆，兆民赖之〖15〗。’其大赦天下，与之更始〖16〗。其明下州郡，咸使闻知。特下燕国，奉宣诏恩。令普天率土〖17〗，备闻斯庆。”","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":13,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":306,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-p054-judgment","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-0463d6981fba6fc7711b","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞臣松之以为：权愎谏违众，信渊意了，非有攻伐之规，重复之虑；宣达锡命，乃用万人：是何不爱其民，昏虐之甚乎？此役也，非惟暗塞，实为无道！","attribution":"裴松之论","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":43,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-de341329beeeef7c7dd5","start":0,"end":69,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
